The claude/*.ndjson, cursor/*.ndjson, opencode/*.ndjson, muse/*.ndjson and acp/*.ndjson transcripts are adapted from T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code, commit
9168ca73d02003557725430b515b44e1551544af, apps/server/src/orchestration-v2/testkit/fixtures/*/claude_transcript.ndjson and
opencode2_{permission,interrupt,inbox,fork,question,background,nested_background,subagent,resume_after_restart}/opencode_transcript.ndjson (recorded OpenCode 2.0.18 HTTP/SSE sessions) and
muse_{permission,subagent_approval,subagent_interrupt,workflow}/muse_transcript.ndjson (recorded Muse Code 1.4.3 to 1.4.6 JSON-RPC sessions) and
{simple,multi_turn,provider_thread_resume,message_steering,turn_interrupt_mid_tool,tool_call_read_only,proposed_plan,queued_turn,skill_invocation,subagent,todo_list}/cursor_transcript.ndjson (recorded @cursor/sdk
public-surface calls, protocol "cursor-agent-sdk.local", model composer-2.5; copied under cursor/ with a shorter file name) and
{simple,multi_turn,queued_turn,message_steering,tool_call_read_only,tool_call_read_only_on_request,turn_interrupt,todo_list,acp_elicitation,acp_titled_multiselect,malformed_session_update,stop_background_work_after_failed_turn}/registry_transcript.ndjson
(recorded ACP JSON-RPC sessions, protocol "acp.ndjson-jsonrpc"; copied under acp/ with a shorter file name)),
